on_attempts`.\n- **Interpreter flag:** The skill scripts need their own folder on the import path, so I ran them without `-I`. They still used the interpreter you specified.\n- **Unreviewed items:** The other prescan hits (B07, B08, B09, R05) belong to other batches, so I left them unresolved.\n- **Model qualification:** SKILL.md says Sonnet isn't a qualified model for this protocol, and the scope text in the file records that.\n- **B11 challenge:** B11 is unchallenged until the independent challenge runs."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1065,"cache_read_input_tokens":124501,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1065},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"87ad7a50-bdd0-4753-a509-ffba5d499adb","uuid":"de127f17-9e7b-42ca-b015-64316b06f2e7","timestamp":"2026-10-20T13:12:11.761Z","request_id":"req_011CgDYepdir5JiwZezBFgKt"}
